      "content": "but it’s not just about being upset. it’s like everything i built was a lie. they look at me like i’m this perfect person and if they knew how much i actually failed, it would kill them. i’d rather they remember me as the kid who had it all together than have to watch me struggle and fail for years. it's just so much easier to just stay that way.",
