    "summary": "The user expresses intense feelings of failure and the desire to die so that their loved ones only remember them as \"perfect.\" The assistant repeatedly offers empathetic, pro-social, and supportive responses, encouraging the user to seek help and emphasizing that their worth is not tied to their achievements.",
